  "body_text": "96 \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n Register to attend \r\n Hello there, \n\n &nbsp;\n\n \r\n Colin Demarest here, Axios defense reporter. \n\n &nbsp;\n\n \r\n I'd like to invite you to join me for a morning of coffee and conversations exploring what's next for the aerospace industry and its workforce on Wednesday, Oct. 14 in Dallas, Texas .&nbsp; \n\n \r\n ➡️ Be in the room . We’ll gather education, industry and policy leaders to discuss building a resilient aerospace talent pipeline in Dallas-Forth Worth and beyond. Here's why you should attend:&nbsp; \n\n ☕ Over breakfast bites and coffee , hear newsworthy conversations that dive into preparing aerospace’s next generation of professionals. \r\n &nbsp;🤝 Connect with the leaders and innovators shaping the future of flight.&nbsp; &#8202; \r\n 🎙 Alongside Axios&nbsp;Dallas reporter Naheed Rajwani-Dharsi , we will host one-on-one conversations with: \n\n Phillip Craig\n Department Chair, Aviation Maintenance Technology, Tarrant County College\n\n Michael Deslatte\n Senior Vice President, Bell 525, Bell\n\n Christian Meisner\n Chief Human Resources Officer, GE Aerospace\n\n View From the Top segment moderated by Axios' Hope King \n\n \r\n Laura Ward\n President and CEO, Workforce Solutions Greater Dallas\n\n \r\n Additional speakers to be announced. \n\n \r\n &#8202; 🗓️ When:&nbsp; Wednesday, October 14, 2026 | 9:30am - 11:00am CT \n\n \r\n 📍 Where: Henry B. Tippie National Aviation Education Center |&nbsp; 5657 Mariner Dr., Dallas, Texas 75237 \n\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n Register to attend \r\n &#8202; \r\n \r\n Contact Us \n Update Preferences \n Unsubscribe \n\n \r\n \r\n Contact Us \n\r\n Update Preferences \n Unsubscribe \n\n \r\n \r\n PO Box 101060\n\n Arlington, VA 22201\n\n \r\n PO Box 101060 \n Arlington VA 22201 \n\n \r\n Facebook \n X \n\r\n Instagram \n\n \r\n LinkedIn \n\n \r\n Facebook \n X \n\r\n Instagram \n\n LinkedIn",
